# This repo's root is the Desktop folder, which also holds a large amount of
# unrelated personal and business material (client records, contracts,
# financial files, etc.) that must NEVER be committed here. To make an
# accidental `git add -A` / `git add .` safe, this file works as an
# allowlist: everything is ignored by default, and only the specific
# project files below are permitted.

# Ignore everything by default
*

# But allow traversal into directories so their contents can be checked
!*/

# Allow only the actual public-deployment project files.
# NOTE: "CWH Property Report/" (the evening batch runner) and
# "CWH Internal Tools/" (the private two-tab Quote Generator app) are
# deliberately NOT allowlisted here — both contain hardcoded local file
# paths, and the latter also contains a real signature/email template.
# They stay fully functional locally; they're just never pushed publicly.
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/requirements.txt
!/streamlit_app.py
!/property_report_engine.py
!/survey_proofreader.py
!/cwh_logo.png

# Re-ignore junk that could otherwise sneak in
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.env
venv/
.venv/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
